<title>USA: Joseph Vostal, ex-Kidder muni banker, dead at 88.</title>
<headline>Joseph Vostal, ex-Kidder muni banker, dead at 88.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Joseph Vostal, a public finance investment banker for 52 years at Kidder Peabody &amp; Co, died Aug 11.</p>
<p>Vostal, who retired in 1975, was 88.</p>
<p>He was a member of the Municipal Bond Club of New York and a former trustee of the Knickerbocker Country Club.</p>
<p>A memorial service was held Friday in Essex Falls, N.J. The family requested that, in lieu of flowers, donations be sent to St Peters Episcopal Church in Essex Falls.</p>
<p>--Reuters Municipal Bond Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
